        {
          "_key": "iqkc1ka1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Not every tool labeled \"AI Design\" deserves the title. Here's how to evaluate whether you're dealing with a genuine Design Agent or just a sophisticated generator:"
