    {
      "_key": "99q7rda5",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "oe1tco1p",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A true Design Agent remembers your preferences. Ask for a social media post today, a banner tomorrow, and an ad next week—all will share consistent colors, typography, and visual language because the agent understands your brand system."
