        {
          "_key": "2oz51yz2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "FAQ: AI Design Tools in 2025"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "vfveqqmz",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ctd8rn6v",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What's the difference between AI image generators and AI Design Agents?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0z81phih",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "vpf6a3su",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Image generators produce standalone images based on prompts. Design Agents understand brand context, maintain consistency across outputs, and handle the full workflow from concept to deployment-ready assets."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "khh3vops",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "cfklz8rh",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Can AI Design Agents replace human designers?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "u60d4281",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4vbd8170",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For routine commercial design work (social posts, ads, basic brand materials), AI Design Agents can handle 80% of the workload efficiently. For strategic branding, conceptual campaigns, and high-end creative direction, human designers remain essential."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "0y5n5qpf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "gkvzpqb2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "How long does it take to set up a brand system in an AI Design Agent?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e42kkr8g",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9xpeqy0g",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Initial brand establishment typically takes 30-60 minutes of conversation. After that, generating consistent assets takes minutes rather than hours or days."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "i862t9te",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "nibi2avp",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Do I need design skills to use an AI Design Agent?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "nh8xtpjy",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "74wl05y4",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No. The core value proposition is translating intent into assets without design expertise. If you can describe what you want in words, you can use a Design Agent effectively."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "9xqj9jit",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "we4zo5x7",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "What about brand consistency across large teams?"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "vrqszc09",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "afwdw7px",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Most Design Agents support team workspaces where brand guidelines are shared. Multiple team members can generate assets that maintain consistency without needing to understand the underlying design system."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "idc1hdjf",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "psyqb5yn",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The Bottom Line"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h2"
    },
    {
      "_key": "rj2igexz",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b3rhilzf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The design industry has changed. The question isn't whether to use AI in your workflow—it's whether you're using AI as a sophisticated generator or as a true Design Agent."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "cwvqbgih",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "ss5cmqjt",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "For most businesses, the generator phase is over. The winners in 2025 and beyond will be those who leverage AI Design Agents to build cohesive brand systems at scale, freeing human creativity for the strategic and conceptual work that actually moves the needle."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7m89hv6m",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1dj5fyem",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The tools have evolved. Your expectations should too."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
